### IngestPipeline

Source: https://github.com/514-labs/moosestack/blob/main/apps/framework-docs-v2/content/moosestack/reference/index.mdx

Combines ingest API, stream, and table creation into a single component.

```APIDOC
## IngestPipeline

### Description
Combines ingest API, stream, and table creation in a single component.

### Configuration Options
- **ingestApi** (boolean | object) - Whether to include an ingest API.
- **stream** (boolean | object) - Configuration for the data stream.
- **table** (boolean | object) - Configuration for the data table.

### Request Example (TypeScript)
```ts
